# ─── Private working notes — never published ─────────────────────────────────
# These live in m/ and are not part of the deliverable. Listed by name as well as
# by directory so they stay ignored if they are ever moved back to the root.
m/
rooman_plan.md
CLAUDE_CODE_PROMPT.md

# ─── Secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env

# ─── Corpus ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Fetched by `research-agent fetch` from data/manifest.yaml. The manifest is the
# reproducible artifact; the PDFs are arXiv's to distribute, not mine (D-006).
data/sources/*.pdf
data/sources/*.md
data/sources/*.txt

# ─── Generated state ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Rebuildable from the corpus in about a minute, and large.
storage/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.npy
.cache/

# ─── Python ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
build/
dist/

# ─── Editors / OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  DELIBERATELY NOT IGNORED — outputs/ is committed on purpose.
#
#  outputs/answers/        12 cited answers, .md + .json
#  outputs/conversations/  4 full multi-turn transcripts
#  outputs/eval_report.md  every measured number
#
#  If a reviewer's machine cannot run Ollama, or they skip setup entirely, the
#  results are still on the page and still scoreable. That is worth more than the
#  ~90 KB it costs.
#
#  The .json files carry only CITED passages, truncated to a 600-character
#  excerpt. Committing full passage text would re-introduce the redistribution
#  question that D-006 avoids by not committing the PDFs.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
